          <AlertDialog open={roadmapCleanupConfirmOpen} onOpenChange={setRoadmapCleanupConfirmOpen}><AlertDialogContent><AlertDialogHeader><AlertDialogTitle>Clear all staged results?</AlertDialogTitle><AlertDialogDescription>This will clear the saved module blueprint, four specialist checkpoints, and assembled Execution Roadmap for this draft. Narrative, Requirements Analysis, System Architecture, and UI/UX Design will remain unchanged.</AlertDialogDescription></AlertDialogHeader><AlertDialogFooter><AlertDialogCancel>Cancel</AlertDialogCancel><AlertDialogAction type="button" className="bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90" onClick={(event) => { event.preventDefault(); void clearExecutionRoadmapStages() }}><Trash2 data-icon="inline-start" />Clear staged results</AlertDialogAction></AlertDialogFooter></AlertDialogContent></AlertDialog>
